    "aboutTitle": "About Zazastro",
    "aboutDescription": "Zazastro is a Traditional Astrology website created to help traditional astrologers read charts. They often encounter tools that offer so many options and unnecessary elements for a traditional reading that they only clutter the chart and get in the way of interpretation.\n\nMade by an astrologer for astrologers, Zazastro combines elegance and minimalism with versatility and pre-calculated elements, such as the Seven Hermetic or Fundamental Arabic Parts and the most popular Fixed Stars. This makes these elements easier to find, whereas on other websites they are often calculated manually, which can make the analysis more prone to errors and slow down the start of the process.\n\nThe site offers controls, features, and menus designed to make chart creation, manipulation, and editing as fast as possible.",
    "aboutInspiration": "The project brings together my interest in astrology and in making an accessible tool for studying and consulting charts.",
